[statement]
A global extended header with no records. bsdtar fails on it, extracting
nothing after it; GNU tar, Python and Go read on. ferrotape refuses it in
every mode.

[archive]
header name=PaxHeader typeflag=g
header name=a
data "x"
header name=b
data "y"
end

